{"t":"034020.KS","n":"Doosan Enerbility Co., Ltd.","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":42850.0,"chg":3150.0,"chgPct":0.07935,"prev":39700.0,"dayH":43400.0,"dayL":40850.0,"w52H":139200.0,"w52L":38400.0,"vol":2183282,"avgVol":2407769,"mcap":27386840088576,"pe":null,"fpe":44.68,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":null,"divY":0.0,"beta":1.89,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","iKo":"특수산업기계","city":"Changwon-si","emp":null,"web":"https://www.doosanenerbility.com","sum":"Doosan Enerbility Co., Ltd. operates as an energy company in South Korea, the Americas, Asia, the Middle East, Europe, and internationally. The company offers new energy solutions, including wind power solutions, gas turbines for power generation, small modular reactors, hydrogen energy, and energy storage systems. It also engages in the manufacture of power generation equipment, including boilers, turbines, and generators; engineering, procurement, and construction of thermal power plants; general construction; seawater desalination; 3D printing technology; and castings and forgings for power plants, marine vessels, steelworks, molds and tool steel, and other various industrial facilities. In addition, it is involved in construction works, including roads, railways, bridges, industrial co","sumKo":"두산에너빌리티(주)는 한국, 미주, 아시아, 중동, 유럽 등 전 세계에서 에너지 기업으로 활동하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 풍력 발전 솔루션, 발전용 가스터빈, 소형 모듈식 원자로, 수소 에너지, 에너지 저장 시스템을 포함한 새로운 에너지 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 보일러, 터빈, 발전기를 포함한 발전 장비 제조에도 종사합니다. 화력 발전소의 엔지니어링, 조달 및 건설; 일반건축; 바닷물 담수화; 3D 프린팅 기술; 발전소, 해양선박, 제철소, 금형공구강 등 각종 산업시설의 주단조품 등을 생산하고 있습니다. 그 밖에도 도로, 철도, 교량, 산업공동체 등의 건설공사에도 참여하고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":15443277650000,"ni":-460399840000},{"y":2023,"rev":17589887710000,"ni":517521900000},{"y":2024,"rev":16233054770000,"ni":381177300000},{"y":2025,"rev":17057876470000,"ni":205162890000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":4859931000000,"ni":727